# Check every text file out with LF, on Windows too.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true hands the working tree CRLF while Prettier is
# pinned to endOfLine: lf, so `npm run format:check` fails on files nobody has
# touched and every save flips the line endings back and forth. It also stops a
# CRLF rewrite from reaching a commit — one did, and turned a 157 line change to
# src/shared/core.js into a 441 line diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git should never look inside.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
